  "details": "Self explanatory.\n\nI know we already have the \"_VRChatMirrorMode\" global parameter, but this doesn't allow to cull stencil operations, so some shaders that make use of the stencil buffer may break next to a mirror.\n\nSo in those edge cases it would be nice to be able to cull the shader or a specific pass entirely from being rendered in mirrors.",
